{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_1000963229#0_2169372018","relevance":3,"reason":"This is the opening segment of the same dedicated Breeze guide titled around what disability insurance is, how it works, and whether it is worth it; it directly frames the topic as protecting income with disability insurance.","learned":"Repeated Breeze evidence: the guide is explicitly dedicated to whether disability insurance is worth it and presents it as income protection."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"disability insurance\" \"worth the cost\" (+ income paycheck salary))","reason":"Look for additional sources beyond Breeze that directly discuss whether disability insurance is worth the cost and tie the value to protecting earnings."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"disability insurance\" \"worth the cost\" (+ income paycheck salary))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_716098836#4_1578677238","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1170","rank":1,"snippet":"your age, gender, occupation, income, and whether you or the employer pays. Most individuals should have some form of disability insurance coverage in place during their working years. The Social Security Administration estimates that one in every four people currently age 20 will be disabled before they reach age 67. The most recent statistics from the Federal Reserve Board suggest that 53 percent of Americans have no emergency savings that would be sufficient in covering monthly expenses should they be out of work due to a sickness or injury. The high prevalence of disability combined with a lack of savings means disability insurance is often <cover>worth the cost. What Part of Disability Insurance is Subject to Taxation? Unlike health insurance premiums, which may be considered a medical expense deduction, disability insurance is not tax deductible. This means that the money you earn that is subsequently used to pay premiums on a disability insurance policy is taxed as ordinary income.</cover>\" , \"start_char\": 2145.000000 , \"title\": \"Is Disability Insurance Tax Deductible? | LendEDU\" , \"url\": \"https://lendedu.com/blog/is-disability-insurance-tax-deductible/\" }"}}
