{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"disability insurance\" \"worth it\" \"one in four\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_49_1441282671#1_2980484282","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1171","rank":1,"snippet":"about long-term disability? Get the right advice, right here What alternatives are there to indivdual long-term disability insurance? Do I need short-term disability insurance? What are the best long-term disability insurance companies? Is long-term disability insurance worth it? \" , \"segment\": \"How much does long-term disability insurance cost? What's good about long-term disability? What's bad about long-term disability? What alternatives are there to indivdual long-term disability insurance? What are the best long-term disability insurance companies? Is long-term <cover>disability insurance worth it? Editorial disclosure Did you know one in four </cover>workers will become disabled before they retire? How will you achieve your financial goals if you can’t work? Long-term disability insurance provides the most comprehensive and cost-effective form of income protection compared to workers' comp, short-term disability insurance, or Social Security disability insurance. Long-term disability insurance is worth having for nearly every worker.\" , \"start_char\": 371.000000 , \"title\": \"Is Long-Term Disability Insurance Worth It?\" , \"url\": \"https://www.policygenius.com/disability-"}}
