{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"disability income insurance\" \"protect\" \"paycheck\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_56_66349169#7_147173229","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1184","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_56_66349169#7_147173229\" , \"end_char\": 4664.000000 , \"headings\": \"Trustmark Paycheck Protect - Disability insurance Trustmark <cover>Paycheck Protect - Disability insurance Disability insurance to protect your income Disability insurance to help you stay on your feet Morgan's story Frequently Asked Questions Also available: Disability Income Insurance</cover>Keep in touch with Voluntary Benefits \" , \"segment\": \"How long will it take Trustmark to handle my claim? We process Paycheck Protect claims within five business days, which includes communication with you to confirm our payment or ask you for more information. What can I spend my benefits on? Anything! We pay you directly, so you can use the money for anything you want, just like your normal paycheck. Also available: Disability Income Insurance Trustmark also offers a traditional disability insurance product that goes to work when you can’t, helping ensure that your life can keep running smoothly even when you are temporarily off your feet. Keep in touch with Voluntary Benefits This insurance policy/group certificate provides coverage for disabilities resulting from covered accidents or covered "}}
