{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"disability insurance\" \"unable to work\" \"paycheck\")"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_32_530462268#4_1010413641","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1186","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_32_530462268#4_1010413641\" , \"end_char\": 3302.000000 , \"headings\": \"Short-Term Disability Insurance Over 37 million Americans are classified as disabled. More than 50% of those disabled are ages 18-64. 1 Short-Term <cover>Disability Insurance Your paycheck helps you maintain your current way of life. If you find yourself unable to work, </cover>Aflac short-term disability insurance will provide cash to help ease the financial stress of a covered illness or injury. No Medical Questions Guaranteed Renewable Aflac Value Rider How it works 3 Affordable Peace of mind doesn't have to break the bank Don’t wait until it’s too late. Help cover yourself and your family with coverage from Aflac. Apologies \" , \"segment\": \"More than 50% of those disabled are ages 18-64. 1 Short-Term Disability Insurance Your paycheck helps you maintain your current way of life. If you find yourself unable to work, Aflac short-term disability insurance will provide cash to help ease the financial stress of a covered illness or injury. Ask your employer about "}}
