{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_41_2062771509#5_3383746308","relevance":3,"reason":"This Guardian page is dedicated to comparing long-term and short-term disability insurance and directly explains the investment rationale: disability insurance helps cover expenses and lost income when illness or injury leaves someone unable to work, especially when emergency savings are insufficient.","learned":"Repeated Guardian evidence: disability insurance is smart financial protection because it can cover lost income and expenses during a disabling illness or injury, filling gaps left by limited emergency savings."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"disability insurance\" \"retirement plans\" \"financial wellbeing\")","reason":"Search for more dedicated disability insurance guidance that explains long-term value in protecting financial wellbeing and retirement plans when disability prevents work."}}
